          onerror="this.hidden=true; this.nextElementSibling.hidden=false;">
        <span class="brand-fallback" hidden>Professor Jerry RV</span>
      </a>

      <button class="nav-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="primary-nav" data-nav-toggle>
        <span class="sr-only">Open navigation</span>
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>

      <nav class="primary-nav" id="primary-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation" data-nav>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#partners">Products & Partners</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        <a class="button button-small" href="tel:+15129156461">Call (512) 915-6461</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="hero-media" role="img"
        aria-label="Placeholder for a photograph of Professor Jerry helping an RV owner"></div>
      <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
      <div class="container hero-content reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Training &#x2022; Service &#x2022; Inspections</p>
        <h1>Understand your RV.<br>Travel with confidence.</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">Patient, practical help for RV owners&#x2014;whether you are buying, learning,
          troubleshooting, or preparing for the next trip.</p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button" href="#contact">Schedule a conversation</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="#services">Explore services</a>
          <button class="button grand-opening-trigger" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog"
            aria-controls="grand-opening-popup" data-sale-open>Grand Opening Sale Info</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="trust-strip" id="highlights" aria-label="Service highlights">
      <div class="container trust-grid">
        <div><strong>Engineer-led</strong><span>Clear, methodical guidance</span></div>
        <div><strong>Owner-focused</strong><span>Teaching, not just fixing</span></div>
        <div><strong>Central Texas</strong><span>Mobile RV support</span></div>
        <div><strong>Independent</strong><span>Objective inspections</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="services">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">How I can help</p>
          <h2>Support for every stage of RV ownership</h2>
          <p>Start with a conversation. We will figure out what you need and what you do not.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-grid three-column">
          <article class="service-card reveal">
            <a class="service-icon-link" href="services.html#training" aria-label="Learn about training">
              <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F393;</span>
            </a>
            <h3 id="training">RV Training</h3>
            <p>Hands-on orientation and patient instruction tailored to your RV, your experience level, and the way you
              travel.</p>
            <a href="services.html#training">Learn about training <span aria-hidden="true">&#x2192;</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card reveal">
            <a class="service-icon-link" href="services.html#service" aria-label="Learn about service">
              <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x1F527;</span>
            </a>
            <h3 id="service">RV Service</h3>
            <p>Practical troubleshooting, maintenance assistance, and straightforward explanations of what failed and
              why.</p>
            <a href="services.html#service">Learn about service <span aria-hidden="true">&#x2192;</span></a>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card reveal">
            <a class="service-icon-link" href="services.html#inspections" aria-label="Learn about inspections">
              <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">&#x2713;</span>
            </a>
            <h3 id="inspections">RV Inspections</h3>
            <center>
              <a href="services.html#inspections" aria-label="Learn about inspections"><img style="width:50px" src="/assets/images/nrvia-patch.png" alt="Certified RV Inspector certification"
                loading="lazy"></a>
            </center>
            <p>Detailed, independent inspections by a <b>National RV Inspectors Association (<a target="_new"
                  href="https://nrvia.org">NRVIA)</a></b> certified inspector that help buyers and owners make informed
              decisions before problems become expensive.</p>
            <a href="services.html#inspections">Learn about inspections <span aria-hidden="true">&#x2192;</span></a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-muted" id="about">
      <div class="container split-layout">
        <div class="photo-placeholder reveal">
          <a class="about-art-link" href="about.html" aria-label="Read Jerry's story"><img src="/assets/images/about-certificates.png" alt=""></a>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Why Professor Jerry?</p>
          <h2>An engineer who enjoys teaching</h2>
          <p class="lead">RV systems can feel mysterious. They become much less intimidating when someone explains how
            the pieces work together.</p>
          <p>Professor Jerry RV combines engineering discipline, real-world RV experience, and a teaching-first
            approach. The goal is not merely to solve today&#x2019;s problem&#x2014;it is to help you understand your RV
            well enough to recognize tomorrow&#x2019;s.</p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>Plain-English explanations</li>
            <li>Methodical troubleshooting</li>
            <li>No-pressure recommendations</li>
            <li>Practical owner education</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="text-link" href="about.html">Read Jerry&#x2019;s story <span aria-hidden="true">&#x2192;</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="partners">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Featured products & partners</p>
          <h2>Useful ideas for better RV living</h2>
          <p>Products and organizations selected for relevance to RV owners. Paid placements will always be clearly
            identified.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="partner-grid" data-partner-grid>
          <article class="partner-card partner-featured reveal">
            <div class="partner-art atlas-art" aria-hidden="true">
              <span>ATLAS</span>
              <small>RV Solutions</small>
            </div>
            <div class="partner-body">
              <span class="tag">A Professor Jerry project</span>
              <h3 id="atlas">Atlas RV Solutions</h3>
              <p>Modular 3D-printed storage and organization products designed specifically for the odd spaces found
                inside RVs.</p>
              <!--
              <a class="button button-dark" href="https://AtlasRV.solutions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit AtlasRV.solutions</a>
              -->
              <span class="button button-dark" style="background-color: #999; color: #ddd;
                   cursor: not-allowed; opacity: 0.6;">
                Visit AtlasRV.solutions
              </span>
              <div style="margin-top: 8px; color: #888; font-style: italic;">
                Coming Soon!
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="partner-card reveal">
            <a class="partner-art" href="rv-picks.html" aria-label="Browse Professor Jerry's Amazon RV Picks"
              style="background: #fbf2e4;">
              <img src="/assets/images/professor-jerry-amazon-rv-picks-tile.png" alt="" width="1536" height="1024"
                loading="lazy" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain;">
            </a>
            <div class="partner-body">
              <span class="tag">Independent recommendations</span>
              <h3 id="rv-picks">Professor Jerry&#x2019;s Amazon RV Picks</h3>
              <p>RV gear I recommend, with notes on where it helps and what to check before you buy.</p>
              <p>I do not receive payment or commissions for these recommendations.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="rv-picks.html">Browse RV picks <span aria-hidden="true">&#x2192;</span></a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="partner-card reveal">
            <a class="partner-art" href="#contact" aria-label="Ask about advertising" style="background: #fbf2e4;">
              <img src="/assets/images/professor-jerry-advertise-with-us.png" alt="" width="1536" height="1024"
                loading="lazy" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain;">
            </a>
            <div class="partner-body">
              <span class="tag">Advertising opportunities</span>
              <h3 id="advertising">Advertise With Us</h3>
              <p>Reach RV owners in Central Texas. Tell us about your RV product, service, or campground and ask about
                advertising on Professor Jerry RV.</p>
              <a class="text-link" href="#contact">Ask about advertising <span aria-hidden="true">&#x2192;</span></a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section testimonial-section" id="testimonials">
      <div class="container narrow reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">What customers say</p>
        <blockquote>
          &#x201C;
          We recently bought our very first RV. Im so happy to have found Professor Jerry, who I asked to come to our RV
          site on our first trial trip. He kindly showed me all the ropes~how to hook up and also gave me so many
          helpful tips.
          We couldn't have managed without his patient and friendly assistance. We plan to use all the services he
          offers.
          &#x201D;
        </blockquote>
        <p class="testimonial-name">&#x2014;Paul</p>
        <hr>
        <blockquote>
          &#x201C;
          Professor Jerry,
          We're so glad we found you!
          Thank you so much for answering all of our questions, coming over to assist in setting up our backup camera on
          our RV, giving us tips on towing and helping us attach our anti-sway bar.
          We also so appreciated you giving us referrals to some of the nicest RV Parks before we went on our first RV
          adventure to Tennessee.
          Thank you so much for your kind and knowledge service! We definitely will be reaching out when its time to
          winterize our RV.
          &#x201D;
        </blockquote>
        <p class="testimonial-name">&#x2014;Missy</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section contact-section" id="contact">
      <div class="container contact-grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Start with a conversation</p>
          <h2>Tell me what is going on with your RV</h2>
          <p>Fill out the form to open a draft in your email app. Review it there, then click Send.</p>
          <div class="contact-details">
            <a href="tel:+15129156461">(512) 915-6461</a>
            <a href="mailto:info@ProfessorJerryRV.com">info@ProfessorJerryRV.com</a>
            <span>Serving Austin and Central Texas</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form id="contact-form" class="contact-form reveal" action="mailto:info@ProfessorJerryRV.com" method="post"
          enctype="text/plain">
          <label>Name<input type="text" name="name" required></label>
          <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required></label>
          <label>Phone<input type="tel" name="phone"></label>
          <label>How can I help?
            <select name="service">
              <option>RV training</option>
              <option>RV service</option>
              <option>RV inspection</option>
              <option>Atlas RV products</option>
              <option>Something else</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>RV manufacturer (optional)
            <input type="text" name="manufacturer" placeholder="ex: Forest River">
          </label>
          <label>RV series (optional)
            <input type="text" name="series" placeholder="ex: Rockwood MiniLite">
          </label>
          <label>RV model number (optional)
            <input type="text" name="model" placeholder="ex: 2515S">
          </label>
          <label>RV model year (optional)
            <input type="text" name="model-year" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{4}" maxlength="4"
              placeholder="ex: 2025">
          </label>
          <label class="full-width">Message<textarea name="message" rows="5" required></textarea></label>
          <button class="button full-width" type="submit">Prepare email</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div>
        <strong>Professor Jerry RV</strong>
        <p>Helping RV Owners Understand Their RV With Confidence.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Explore</strong>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="index.html#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Policies</strong>
        <a href="privacy.html">Privacy policy</a>
        <a href="code-of-ethics.html">Code of ethics</a>
        <a href="advertising.html">Advertising disclosure</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Connect</strong>
        <a href="#">Facebook</a>
        <a href="#">YouTube</a>
        <a href="https://AtlasRV.solutions">Atlas RV Solutions</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container footer-bottom">
      <span>&#xA9; <span data-year></span> Professor Jerry RV</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/site.js"></script>
  <script>
    (() => {
      const form = document.getElementById("contact-form");

      form.addEventListener("submit", (event) => {
        event.preventDefault();

        const data = new FormData(form);
        const read = (name) => String(data.get(name) ?? "").trim();
        const fields = [
          ["Name", "name"],
          ["Email", "email"],
          ["Phone", "phone"],
          ["Service", "service"],
          ["RV manufacturer", "manufacturer"],
          ["RV series", "series"],
          ["RV model number", "model"],
          ["RV model year", "model-year"],
        ];
        const lines = fields
          .map(([label, name]) => [label, read(name)])
          .filter(([, value]) => value)
          .map(([label, value]) => `${label}: ${value}`);

        lines.push("", "Message:", read("message"));
        const subject = encodeURIComponent("Professor Jerry RV inquiry");
        const body = encodeURIComponent(lines.join("\n").replace(/\r?\n/g, "\r\n"));
        window.location.href = `${form.action}?subject=${subject}&body=${body}`;
      });
    })();
  </script>

  <dialog class="grand-opening-popup" id="grand-opening-popup" aria-label="Professor Jerry RV Grand Opening Sale">
    <img class="grand-opening-popup__image" src="/assets/images/grandopeningsale.png"
      alt="Professor Jerry RV Grand Opening Sale. 20% off most services through December 31, 2026. See individual services for details."
      width="1536" height="1024">
    <div class="grand-opening-popup__actions">
      <a class="button button-small" href="/index.html#services">View services and sale prices</a>
      <button class="button button-small button-secondary" type="button" data-sale-dismiss autofocus>Dismiss</button>
    </div>
  </dialog>
  <script src="assets/js/grand-opening.js" defer></script>
</body>

</html>
